#question(title: [Negation 1], centered: true)[
  Write the negation of these statements as
  simply as possible:

  + My favourite integer number is greater
    than $7$.
  + I know at least five students at U of T
    who have a cellphone.
  + There is a country in the European Union
    with fewer than 1000 inhabitants.
  + All of my friends like apples.
  + I like apples and oranges.

  #v(1fr)

  #align(center)[Negation of
  $display(#boxed[$display(#text(fill: blue)[$display(dots.c)$])$])$
  #h(.25em) = #h(.25em)
  $display(#boxed[$display(#text(fill: blue)[$display(dots.c)$])$])$
  is false.]
]
